1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,860
Start button-ai press panninaa mixer odum. Stop button-ai press panninaa ninnudum. Idhai pona episode-la holding logic vechu paathom.

2
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:17,160
ipo namma oru tank-la irukkura product-ai oru kurippitta nerathukku mix pannanum. Neram mudinjadhum mixer thaanaave nindranum. Operator pakkathula ninnu stopwatch paathutte irukkanumaa?

3
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,930
Thevai illa. Indha velaiyai PLC timer vechu pannalaam.

4
00:00:21,810 --> 00:00:32,440
Oru batch mixing tank-ai eduthukkalaam. Ingredients ellam tank-la add panniyaachu. Ippo Start press panninaa, mixer muppadhu second odanum. Muppadhu second mudinjadhum automaticah stop aaganum.

5
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:40,960
Inga muppadhu second-nguradhu namma explanation-kaana example. Actual factory-la mixing time, product recipe-ku etha maadhiri set pannuvaanga.

6
00:00:41,750 --> 00:00:44,840
Aanaa mixing nadakkumbodhe operator Stop press pannittaa?

7
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:52,800
Marubadi Start pannumbodhu, full muppadhu second mix pannanumaa? Illa already mix pannina neram poga, meedhi neram mattum mix panninaa podhumaa?

8
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:57,590
Indha rendu behaviour-aiyum non-retentive, retentive timers vechu paakkalaam.

9
00:00:58,700 --> 00:01:01,350
Mudhal-la indha process-ku enna thevai-nu paarppom.

10
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:11,970
Oru Start button. Oru Stop button. Mixer-ai control panna oru output. Mixing nadakkudhunu remember panna oru internal bit. Adhukku aduthadhaa oru timer.

11
00:01:12,810 --> 00:01:15,050
Indha internal bit-ai Mixing Run-nu koopiduvom.

12
00:01:16,130 --> 00:01:23,440
Start button-ai press pannumbodhu Mixing Run ON aagum. Pona episode-la paatha holding logic maadhiriye, button-ai vittaalum indha bit ON-la irukkum.

13
00:01:24,350 --> 00:01:30,250
Indha Mixing Run bit-ai use panni mixer output-ai ON panrom. Adhe bit-ai timer-oda input-kum kudukkurom.

14
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:35,240
Adhanaala mixing start aagumbodhu mixer-um odum, timer-um count panna aarambikkum.

15
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:41,510
Timer-la namma set pannura nerathai preset time-nu solluvom. Inga preset time muppadhu second.

16
00:01:42,550 --> 00:01:48,560
Timer idhuvaraikkum count pannina nerathai elapsed time-nu solluvom. Pathu second count aayirundhaa, elapsed time pathu second.

17
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:56,220
Elapsed time, preset time-ai reach pannumbodhu timer-oda done signal ON aagum. Adhaavadhu, set panna neram mudinjiduchunu indicate pannum.

18
00:01:56,780 --> 00:02:00,250
Ippo mudhal-la non-retentive ON-delay timer-ai paakkalaam.

19
00:02:00,770 --> 00:02:09,450
ON-delay-naa, timer input ON aanadhum done signal udane ON aagaadhu. Set panna neram mudinja piraguthaan ON aagum.

20
00:02:10,560 --> 00:02:13,740
Aanaa inga mixer udane odudhe? Appo delay enga irukku?

21
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,720
Idhudhaan mukkiyamaana point.

22
00:02:16,320 --> 00:02:23,290
Mixer-ai timer done signal moolamaa start pannala. Mixing Run bit moolamaa start panrom.

23
00:02:23,950 --> 00:02:32,600
Timer done signal-ai, mixing time mudinjiduchunu therinjukkaradhukku use panrom. Andha signal vandhadhum mixer-ai stop panna program panrom.

24
00:02:33,570 --> 00:02:34,720
Ippo full working-ai paarunga.

25
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:44,730
Operator Start press pannuraar. Mixing Run ON aagudhu. Mixer output ON aagudhu. Tank-kulla blades rotate aagi ingredients mix aaga aarambikkudhu.

26
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:49,030
Adhe nerathula timer zero-lendhu count panna aarambikkudhu.

27
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:54,440
Pathu second aayiduchu. Mixer odikitte irukku. Timer done signal innum OFF.

28
00:02:55,170 --> 00:03:00,090
Irubadhu second aayiduchu. Mixer innum odikitte irukku. Yennaa namma set pannadhu muppadhu second.

29
00:03:00,700 --> 00:03:02,110
Muppadhu second reach aagudhu.

30
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:09,250
Ippo timer-oda done signal ON aagum. Indha signal-ai use panni Mixing Run bit-ai OFF panrom.

31
00:03:09,910 --> 00:03:16,680
Mixing Run OFF aanadhum mixer output-um OFF aagum. Motor-ku run command ninnudum. Blades slow aagi stop aagum.

32
00:03:17,320 --> 00:03:26,210
Idhula timer mixer power-ai direct-aa cut pannala. Timer time mudinjadhai indicate pannudhu. Namma PLC logic dhaan mixer output-ai OFF pannudhu.

33
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:30,920
Seri, Mixing Run OFF aagiduchu. Appo timer-oda input-um OFF aagume?

34
00:03:31,670 --> 00:03:38,120
Aamaam. Adhanaala indha non-retentive timer-oda elapsed time zero-ku reset aagum. Done signal-um OFF aagidum.

35
00:03:38,890 --> 00:03:41,960
Appo done signal OFF aanadhum mixer marubadi start aagidumaa?

36
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:48,570
Aagaadhu. Mixing Run bit already OFF aagiduchu. Adhai marubadi ON panna pudhusaana Start request thevai.

37
00:03:49,200 --> 00:03:53,210
Namma example-la ovvoru Start request-kum oru mixing cycle dhaan.

38
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:55,520
Ippo innoru situation paarppom.

39
00:03:56,020 --> 00:04:01,150
Mixing start panni pathinainju second aayirukku. Aanaa operator Stop press pannuraar.

40
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:04,240
Ippo muppadhu second mudiyura varaikkum mixer odumaa?

41
00:04:05,210 --> 00:04:17,350
Odaadhu. Stop command vandhadhum Mixing Run OFF aagum. Mixer output-um OFF aagum. Timer input OFF aaguradhaala, count pannina pathinainju second-um reset aagum.

42
00:04:17,960 --> 00:04:19,910
Marubadiyum Start press panninaa enna aagum?

43
00:04:20,420 --> 00:04:26,150
Meedhi pathinainju second mattum count aagaadhu. Zero-lendhu pudhusaa muppadhu second count aagum.

44
00:04:26,450 --> 00:04:29,440
Yennaa namma use pannuradhu non-retentive timer. Input OFF aanadhum count pannina time-ai adhu retain pannaadhu.

45
00:04:30,020 --> 00:04:32,630
Aanaa namma process requirement vera maadhiri irundhaa?

46
00:04:33,220 --> 00:04:39,180
“Mixer mothamaa muppadhu second odinaa podhum. Naduvula stop panninaalum, already mix pannina nerathai marakka vendaam” nu sonnaa?

47
00:04:39,900 --> 00:04:42,060
Appodhaan retentive timer use pannalaam.

48
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:47,470
Adhe mixing tank. Adhe muppadhu-second preset. Indha murai retentive timer vechu paakkalaam.

49
00:04:47,900 --> 00:04:54,080
Start press panrom. Mixing Run ON aagudhu. Mixer odudhu. Timer zero-lendhu count panna aarambikkudhu.

50
00:04:54,820 --> 00:04:56,550
Pathinainju second-la Stop press panrom.

51
00:04:57,400 --> 00:05:02,440
Mixing Run OFF aagum. Mixer output-um OFF aagum. Timer count pannuradhu ninnudum.

52
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:07,320
Aanaa elapsed time zero-ku pogaadhu. Pathinainju second-la appadiye irukkum.

53
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:12,270
Inga mixer ninnuduchu. Timer mattum count pannitte irukkum-nu purinjukka vendaam.

54
00:05:12,790 --> 00:05:17,730
Timer-um count pannuradhai niruthum. Already count pannina pathinainju second-ai mattum remember pannum.

55
00:05:18,450 --> 00:05:20,020
Ippo marubadiyum Start press panrom.

56
00:05:20,620 --> 00:05:25,190
Mixer odum. Timer zero-lendhu aarambikkaadhu. Pathinainju second-lendhu continue aagum.

57
00:05:25,790 --> 00:05:29,200
Innum pathinainju second mix pannadhum total muppadhu second complete aagum.

58
00:05:29,850 --> 00:05:34,500
Timer done signal ON aagum. Namma logic Mixing Run-ai OFF panni mixer-ai stop pannum.

59
00:05:35,370 --> 00:05:40,130
Mudhal-la pathinainju second. Restart-ku appuram pathinainju second. Mothamaa muppadhu second mixing.

60
00:05:40,850 --> 00:05:43,790
Naduvula mixer ninnirundha nerathai indha mixing time-la serkka maattom.

61
00:05:44,250 --> 00:05:51,350
Idhudhaan retentive timer-oda mukkiyamaana difference. Timer input OFF aanaalum, already count pannina time retain aagum.

62
00:05:51,940 --> 00:05:54,210
Seri, andha saved time-ai clear pannanumnaa?

63
00:05:54,750 --> 00:05:59,870
Separate Reset command thevai. intha concept ku nama extra oru reset push button add pannanum

64
00:06:00,310 --> 00:06:07,350
Namma example-la mixer stop-la irukkumbodhu Reset press panninaa, elapsed time zero aagum. Timer-oda done status-um clear aagum.

65
00:06:07,980 --> 00:06:11,130
Adhukku appuram Start press panninaa, fresh-aa muppadhu second count pannum.

66
00:06:11,730 --> 00:06:17,210
Adhe maadhiri, batch complete aagi adutha batch-ku pogumbodhum old timer value-ai reset panna logic irukkanum.

67
00:06:17,850 --> 00:06:23,550
Namma sequence-la, pudhusaana batch start pannumbodhu timer-ai reset pannittu fresh cycle start panna arrange pannalaam.

68
00:06:24,340 --> 00:06:26,990
Appo Stop-um Reset-um ore velai illa.

69
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:33,090
Indha retentive example-la Stop press panninaa mixer nikkum. Count pannina time appadiye irukkum.

70
00:06:33,890 --> 00:06:36,230
Reset command kuduthaa, saved time-um clear aagum.

71
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:38,920
Ippo rendu timer-aiyum pakkathula vechu paarunga.

72
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:43,700
Rendulayum preset muppadhu second. Rendulayum pathinainju second-la Stop press panrom.

73
00:06:44,410 --> 00:06:46,470
Non-retentive timer zero-ku reset aagum.

74
00:06:46,990 --> 00:06:48,920
Retentive timer pathinainju second-la nikkum.

75
00:06:49,710 --> 00:06:54,110
Marubadi Start press panninaa, non-retentive example-la full muppadhu second mixing nadakkum.

76
00:06:54,670 --> 00:06:57,570
Retentive example-la meedhi pathinainju second mixing nadakkum.

77
00:06:58,370 --> 00:06:59,270
Appo edhu better?

78
00:07:00,120 --> 00:07:02,420
Namma process-ku edhu thevaiyo, adhu dhaan correct.

79
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:07,540
Naduvula stop aana fresh full mixing cycle venumnaa, adhukku etha logic use pannanum.

80
00:07:08,290 --> 00:07:13,210
Already odina mixing time-ai serthu calculate pannanumnaa, adhukku etha retentive logic use pannanum.

81
00:07:14,100 --> 00:07:17,110
Actual factory-la indha decision product recipe-ai poruthadhu.

82
00:07:17,970 --> 00:07:19,280
Inga innoru vishayam gavanikkanum.

83
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:27,880
PLC output ON irukkuradhu mattum mixer nijamaave odudhunguradhukku proof illa. Drive fault aagirukkalaam, illa motor run aagaama irukkalaam.

84
00:07:28,510 --> 00:07:38,550
Adhanaala actual machine-la running feedback thevai-na, adhaiyum check panni mixing time count panna logic design pannanum. Namma basic example-la mixer normal-aa run aagudhunu assume panrom.

85
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:53,180
Retentive-naa power OFF aanaalum ellaa PLC-layum time kandippaa save aagum-nu artham illa. Adhu PLC model, timer instruction, memory settings-ai poruthadhu. Inga namma compare pannadhu timer input OFF aagumbodhu enna nadakkudhunguradhai.

86
00:07:53,910 --> 00:07:54,870
Ippo ungalukku oru question.

87
00:07:55,780 --> 00:08:00,290
Muppadhu-second retentive mixing cycle-la, pathinainju second mudinjadhum Stop press pannittom.

88
00:08:01,060 --> 00:08:04,490
Reset press pannala. Marubadi Start mattum press panrom.

89
00:08:05,160 --> 00:08:06,610
Mixer innum evlo neram odum?

90
00:08:07,690 --> 00:08:10,050
Option A — Meedhi pathinainju second.

91
00:08:10,660 --> 00:08:13,060
Option B — Pudhusaa muppadhu second.

92
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:15,840
Option C — Start aana udane ninnudum.

93
00:08:16,420 --> 00:08:19,070
Unga answer-ai A, B, illa C-nu comment pannunga!

94
00:08:19,750 --> 00:08:27,420
Seri, timer vechu nerathai measure pannittom. Aanaa oru box-la sariyaa aaru bottles pack pannanumnaa, PLC epdi count pannum?

95
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:30,390
Adutha episode-la PLC counter-ai paakkalaam!

96
00:08:31,150 --> 00:08:36,380
PLC concepts-ai indha maadhiri practical examples-oda kathukka, Factory Decode Tamil channel-ai subscribe pannunga!

